        <activityName xml:lang="en">Solar collector factory</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Solar collector factory
Factory with an annual production of 100'000m2 and a life time of 50 years.;
UUID: 6ff1894d-def7-30ff-a1ea-a26c0918f143
Building, land occupation and transformation of a factory for flat plate collectors. Not including machinery.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Factory for production of solar collectors. 
Time period: Material data have been investigated for a collector produced in 2002. Data for energy uses during production have been investigated for 2001.
Production volume: Calculation for a production volume of 100'000m2.
Sampling: Questionnaires. 
Extrapolations: Average of two plants as assumption for several plants in Europe.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6ff1894d-def7-30ff-a1ea-a26c0918f143.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
